title: Microsoft 365 AitM Token-Replay Sign-In from Huntress Campaign IPs
id: 2e023946-953d-412a-952f-186ceef957b3
status: experimental
description: Detects Microsoft 365 / Entra ID sign-ins from the two German-hosted IP addresses Huntress attributed to a ten-week adversary-in-the-middle token-replay campaign (July 14 - September 22, 2026). Attackers replayed session tokens that MFA had already satisfied, producing 497 successful sign-ins across 97 accounts at 79 organizations.
references:
  - https://www.huntress.com/blog/token-replay-spray
  - https://thehackernews.com/2026/10/microsoft-365-token-replay-attacks.html
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026/10/27
tags:
  - attack.t1557
  - attack.t1539
  - attack.t1550
  - attack.t1078
logsource:
  product: azure
  service: signinlogs
detection:
  selection_campaign_ip:
    IPAddress:
      - '193.26.115.199'
      - '193.26.115.221'
  condition: selection_campaign_ip
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate sign-ins from tenants or partners that egress through the same German hosting range
level: high
